# Helty Clinical UI

Match **Walk-in Queue** (`lib/src/doctor/walk_in/`) for all new or redesigned screens. Do not invent a parallel look.

## Canonical pieces

- Surfaces: `HeltySurfaceCard`, `HeltyStatusChip`, `AppTheme.radiusSm/Md/Lg`, `AppTheme.spaceSm/Md`
- Icons: `HeltySolidIcon` — **opaque** rounded square, **white** glyph, **distinct** color per control (never `primary.withValues(alpha: 0.12)`)
- Overflow: `HeltyEllipsisText` / `HeltyEllipsisChip` — 1 line, ellipsis, tooltip on hover
- Palette: `ColorScheme` + `DepartmentColors`. Accent tiles: blue `#2563EB`, teal `#0D9488`, purple `#7C3AED`, pink `#DB2777`, indigo `#4F46E5`, green `#16A34A`, amber `#EA580C`

## Page chrome

- Compact header: solid title icon + title/subtitle + optional live clock. No oversized CTAs crowding the title
- KPI row: small `HeltySurfaceCard`s, solid icon tiles, label / large value / caption. Dense padding (`8–10`)
- Filters on **one row**: search + primary dropdowns. Extra controls (dates, advanced) go behind a **filter icon** (`HeltySolidIcon` + menu/dialog), not a second fat toolbar
- Utility rail (Quick Actions / lists / notes): **full height** beside main content from `≥1100`. Stack or a compact sheet below that. Cards inside the rail stretch to fill leftover height
- Section gaps ~`10–12`, not `24`

## Tables

- Zebra: odd rows `onSurface` at ~`0.035` alpha — subtle, not a block fill
- Column gutters ~`20px`. Do not pack cells flush
- Overflow: ellipsis + tooltip; never wrap a row taller for long text
- **Pin** row-count + pagination to the card footer. Horizontal scroll applies to header/rows only, never the footer
- Row actions: compact `View`/`Start` + kebab; `FittedBox` if the action cluster is tight

## Data

- Bind real APIs. Missing metrics stay `—`. Do not fake counts or activity
- Keep existing query params and mutations; UI redesign is not a contract change

## Layout

Follow `.cursor/rules/flutter-responsive.mdc` (`ResponsiveBody`, `AppBreakpoints`). Walk-in extras: cards `<768`, side rail `≥1100`.
